<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.4">
<l>maṅkiya valviṉai nōykā ḷumakkumōr valviṉai kaṇṭīr</l>
<l>iṅkup pukēṉmiṉ pukēṉmi ṉeḷitaṉṟu kaṇṭīr pukēṉmiṉ</l>
<l>ciṅkap pirāṉava ṉemmāṉ cērun tirukkōyil kaṇṭīr</l>
<l>paṅkap paṭātuyyap pōmiṉ paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Disease of the powerful karma that is death, Look! </l>
<l rend="indent">There is a powerful karma for you [too]!</l>
<l>Do not enter here! Look!</l>
<l rend="indent">It’s not easy, do not enter! Do not enter!</l>
<l>Look at [this] holy temple where our king abides,</l>
<l rend="indent">he who is the lion Lord!</l>
<l>Go to be saved without defeat!</l>
<l rend="indent">Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
